3 Ways to Create a NodeGroup in EKS:

1️⃣ AWS Console
 Perfect for beginners who enjoy spending hours navigating endless options, missing key settings, and getting frustrated when things don’t scale automatically. But hey, at least everything’s done manually, right? 🙄

2️⃣ Terraform
 Why settle for a few lines of code when you can write 150? Ideal for those who thrive on managing state files, dependencies, and working through Terraform’s quirks. A “simple” nodegroup takes just a few more lines. 💻✨

3️⃣ eksctl
 One command, and it’s done. Fast, simple, and efficient. But don’t worry—real pros will still make it unnecessarily complicated with the other two options. 🥇
